# The PR-Agent source is copied from the immutable checkout in
# build-bundle.sh; it is intentionally not a VCS requirement here because
# pip's --require-hashes cannot authenticate a mutable git source. The source
# identity is bound in the bundle manifest and Docker labels.
#
# Keep every upstream runtime dependency explicit so the bundle cannot silently
# resolve a newer framework. Transitive hashes are emitted in requirements.lock.
